Provenance note

This repository contains original source only. The projects under
src/ModReady.UIExtenderEx, src/ModReady.ButterLib and src/ModReady.MCM are
clean-room implementations of the corresponding public API surfaces used by
Bannerlord mods. They were written from the observable public API (type,
member and signature names) so that consumer mods compiled against those APIs
load unmodified. No source or binary code from BUTR
(https://github.com/BUTR) is copied, vendored, decompiled into, or
redistributed by this repository.

ModReady is not affiliated with or endorsed by BUTR. Third-party components
redistributed in release archives (Harmony, Mono.Cecil, MonoMod,
Newtonsoft.Json, and others) are MIT-licensed and listed with their notices in
Modules/ModReady/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt inside each release zip.
